"control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Und wenn wir die Grenzen auch benennen wollen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_002_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Dann ergänze ich: \"die Studie schränkt diese Aussage jedoch ein\".","speaker":"Merit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_002_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Merit, im Fazit schreibst du \"die Studie zeigt\". Können wir das schärfer fassen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_002_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Vielleicht \"die Studie belegt\" — das unterstreicht die Beweiskraft stärker.","speaker":"Merit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_002_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Und wenn wir die Grenzen auch benennen wollen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_002_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Dann ergänze ich: \"die Studie schränkt diese Aussage jedoch ein\".","speaker":"Merit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_002_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ein Institut nimmt ein Verfahren auf, wenn es damit beginnt, und übernimmt es von anderen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Eine Doktorandin verwechselt zwei Verben. Erklär ihr die Differenz.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Nimm „die Studie belegt\"; das hebt die Beweiskraft hervor.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Deine Kollegin schreibt im Fazit „die Studie zeigt\" und fragt, ob das schärfer geht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Die Studie legt drei Muster dar, weist auf eine Lücke hin und schränkt die Reichweite ein.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Stell die Befunde eines Projekts wissenschaftlich vor.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Der Journalismus greift zu bildhaften Präfixen, die Wissenschaft wählt blasse, weil sie Präzision braucht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-02-verben-mit-praefixen","level":"C2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"In der Debatte geht es um Fachsprache und Presse. Nimm Stellung.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Hier ersetzen wir zeigen durch nachweisen, dort sagen durch darlegen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","contr